1. ETHICAL PEACE PROTEST CLAUSE
   As a peaceful humanitarian protest against the unprovoked military aggression,
   violence, and invasion of Ukraine by the Russian Federation, and in memory of
   the tragic lessons of history regarding state-sponsored violence and war crimes:
   
   a) This Software, any of its components, derivatives, or modifications, MUST NOT
      be translated, localized, or otherwise adapted into the Russian language within
      any user interface, configuration, resource files, or user-facing documentation.
   b) Any public or private deployment of this Software or its derivatives MUST NOT
      present a Russian language user interface to its users.
   c) This restriction (Section 1) shall be automatically repealed and rendered null
      and void only upon the complete cessation of all military activities by the
      Russian Federation against Ukraine, the full and verifiable withdrawal of all
      Russian military forces, personnel, and proxies from all internationally
      recognized territories of Ukraine as of 1991 (including Crimea and Donbas),
      and the full settlement of war reparations to Ukraine.

